      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm all for this as long as it is a configurable option in-game (as opposed to editing config files), not a blanket ban of \"all avatars over X size\" get blocked.\n\nI've seen some 500MB+ avatars poppin' up in cache and that's just obscene.\n\nAnother nice feature would be to download avatars from smallest to largest or remove the blocking to allow more concurrent avatar downloads.",
      "viewerReactions": null
