      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have an extremely slow internet compared to the rest of the world, 5 MB download speed. I have my safety set to show nothing besides friends just so I wouldn't lag the whole time because I'm downloading some person's huge colorful avatar.\n\nHowever, that makes me unable to interact with anyone because I see everyone as a gray avatar and makes me react awkwardly towards them. This option would be a huge lifesaver for people that have internet problems like I do.\n\nThe Small to Big file sized avatar download would also help a lot of people interact more with the players in the room.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
