  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As the title says, add a download limiter for avatars.\n\nIf avatar size exceeds N value then skip download and show a gray avatar instead.\n\nThis way we don't need to wait for large avatars to download and will actually free up a lot of memory and cache space.\n\n\n\nAlso partially creating it for the meme, but it would actually be nice to have as I really don't want to go into public worlds and download extremely large avatar files as I'd probably hide the avatar anyway.",
